ÌWith graduation projects in full swing, Takemoto and Hagu are face-to-face with their future. Takemoto's complete lack of job prospects are making a sad situation worse, and Hagu just wants to return to her home in the country to paint. With pressures mounting from the outside world, what life-altering choices will these two make?"Û
